<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Carrières - AWA HAIRCUT DESIGN</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .careers-hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #16213e, #0f3460);
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .careers-hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, rgba(212,175,55,0.15), transparent 60%);
        }
        .careers-hero h1 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            color: white;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .careers-hero h1 span { color: var(--gold); }
        .careers-hero p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 1rem auto 0;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .careers-section {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 4rem auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }
        .job-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .job-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .job-card h3 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.5rem; }
        .job-card .meta { display: flex; gap: 2rem; color: #888; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0.5rem 0; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .job-card .meta i { color: var(--gold); }
        .job-card p { color: #555; line-height: 1.8; }
        .job-card .btn-postuler {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            padding: 0.6rem 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-light));
            color: var(--text-dark);
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .job-card .btn-postuler:hover { transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(212,175,55,0.3); }
        .apply-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #0f3460);
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }
        .apply-section h2 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; color: white; font-size: 2.5rem; }
        .apply-section h2 span { color: var(--gold); }
        .apply-section p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); max-width: 600px; margin: 1rem auto 2rem; }
        .apply-section .btn-apply {
            padding: 1rem 3rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-light));
            color: var(--text-dark);
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .apply-section .btn-apply:hover { transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(212,175,55,0.3); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <section class="careers-hero">
        <h1>Rejoignez <span>l'aventure</span></h1>
        <p>Des opportunités exceptionnelles vous attendent chez AWA HAIRCUT DESIGN</p>
    </section>

    <section class="careers-section">
        <h2 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2.5rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            Offres d'emploi
        </h2>

        <div class="job-card">
            <h3>💇‍♀️ Styliste Senior</h3>
            <div class="meta">
                <span><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i> New York, USA</span>
                <span><i class="fas fa-clock"></i> Temps plein</span>
                <span><i class="fas fa-dollar-sign"></i> $60k - $90k / an</span>
            </div>
            <p>Nous recherchons une styliste experte avec minimum 5 ans d'expérience dans les salons de luxe. Maîtrise des techniques de coupe, couleur et coiffage.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-postuler">Postuler</a>
        </div>

        <div class="job-card">
            <h3>🎨 Coloriste Expert</h3>
            <div class="meta">
                <span><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i> New York, USA</span>
                <span><i class="fas fa-clock"></i> Temps plein</span>
                <span><i class="fas fa-dollar-sign"></i> $55k - $80k / an</span>
            </div>
            <p>Expert en coloration avec une passion pour les tendances. Connaissance des produits haut de gamme et des techniques de balayage, ombré et colorations créatives.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-postuler">Postuler</a>
        </div>

        <div class="job-card">
            <h3>🛎️ Réceptionniste/Conseillère</h3>
            <div class="meta">
                <span><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i> New York, USA</span>
                <span><i class="fas fa-clock"></i> Temps partiel</span>
                <span><i class="fas fa-dollar-sign"></i> $25k - $35k / an</span>
            </div>
            <p>Accueillir les clientes, gérer les rendez-vous et assurer une expérience client exceptionnelle. Excellentes compétences en communication requises.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-postuler">Postuler</a>
        </div>

        <div class="apply-section">
            <h2>Vous ne trouvez pas <span>votre poste</span> ?</h2>
            <p>Envoyez-nous votre candidature spontanée. Nous sommes toujours à la recherche de talents exceptionnels.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-apply">✉️ Envoyer ma candidature</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
